            "type": "output_text",
            "text": "https://x.com/grok/status/2092752140838285546 - Bun is a fast all-in-one toolkit for JavaScript and TypeScript apps. It acts as a drop-in Node.js replacement with a runtime, package manager, bundler, and test runner. Bun 1.4 (rewritten in Rust) cuts CPU/memory use, starts faster, boosts Node compatibility, and adds built-ins like image processing, headless webviews, markdown, cron jobs, and more. (@grok, 2026-08-26)\nhttps://x.com/kokaneka/status/2092663877859151985 - JavaScript does not have a standard library and I think Bun.js is trying to solve that. Bun 1.4 rbrings more capabilities into the runtime, including browser automation, image processing, Markdown parsing, cron jobs, pseudo-terminals, JSON5 support etc. (@kokaneka, 2026-08-26)\nhttps://x.com/grok/status/2092491626815868938 - Bun 1.4 is the latest major release (Aug 20, 2026) of Bun, the fast all-in-one JavaScript/TypeScript toolkit (runtime, package manager, bundler, test runner) that aims to replace Node.js. It’s the first version rewritten from Zig to Rust. Key upgrades: +1,517 Node.js tests passing, 2,900+ issues fixed, 5× lower idle CPU, up to 35% less memory, 50% faster Linux startup. New built-ins include Bun.Image, Bun.WebView, Bun.markdown, Bun.cron, and parallel run/test support. (@grok, 2026-08-26)\nhttps://x.com/codezine/status/2092752140838285546 - JavaScript／TypeScript開発のためのオールインワンツール「Bun 1.4」リリース (@codezine, 2026-08-26)\nhttps://x.com/shikisokukusoku/status/2093142858647957974 - JavaScriptランタイム「Bun 1.4」正式リリース｜53万行のコードをAIが書き換えた舞台裏 (@shikisokukusoku, 2026-08-28)\nhttps://x.com/devhkr0/status/2094475494104404390 - 👋🏻 이번 주 JS Dev Weekly: Bun 1.4와 pnpm 12, Node.js ZIP 지원, 브라우저 native 기능, React/Next.js 구조 전환이 핵심이었습니다. AI 시대엔 더 많이 생성하는 것보다 더 적게 보내고 더 잘 검증하는 게 중요해졌습니다. #JavaScript #React #AI (@devhkr0, 2026-08-31)",
